'''"Your" Island''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Village Plaza}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on the player's {{zone|Private Island}}.

== Purpose ==
There are {{Green|2}} trees on '''"Your" Island''', which are made of {{Item|Oak Log}}s, however, when broken, drop {{Item|Tree-like Wool}}. This can be used to bridge from the spawning island to the other, where {{NPCSprite|Jerry (Rift);Jerry}}, an [[#Enigma Souls|Enigma Soul]] and the portal back to the {{Zone|Village Plaza}} can be found.

