== Trivia ==
*The player receives two objectives when they enter '''"Your" Island''', the first being {{Yellow|Break a log}}, and the next {{Yellow|You know the rest}}, referencing the fact that the player has already done what they must do next before.
*The fake sky and clouds made of wool may be a reference to the similar construct shown in ''[[mcw:Minecraft: Story Mode|Minecraft: Story Mode]]'', where part of a fake overworld made of wool was built in the End: this, in turn, was likely inspired by ''[[w:The Truman Show|The Truman Show]]''.
*Due to the {{Item|remmaH yniT}} using an Iron Axe texture, it can be used to break the trees faster than using other items.

